Third-party notice

`cordis.patch.yml` contains agent-preset declarations copied from
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app` (`presets/standard.patch.yml`, `presets/cordis.patch.yml`,
`presets/ptc.patch.yml`), part of DeepSeek Harness, which is distributed under
the MIT License: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

Those copies exist only because DSH replaces a patch row wholesale when a later
layer targets the same row id; the only supported way to change one nested
value inside a preset declaration is to restate the whole declaration. See
"The preset-override problem" in README.md.
